    "field": "Steric sea level change estimation",
    "problem": "Accurately tracking steric sea level change is a significant challenge due to the lack of standardized practices for quantifying and propagating uncertainties that arise from sparse observations, diverse methodologies, and instrumental errors.",
    "method": "This review proposes improving steric sea level uncertainty estimates through greater clarity, international standards, and developing community \u201crecipes\u201d to quantify error covariances from observations and sparse sampling and to propagate uncertainty across scales.",
    "task": "The task is to review current practices for estimating steric sea level change, with a particular focus on the methodologies and techniques used to quantify and treat the associated uncertainties.",
