    "innovation": "This paper reviews current practices for estimating steric sea level change and its associated uncertainty, advocating for greater clarity, adoption of international standards, and community-developed \"recipes\" for quantifying and propagating errors from sparse data and observational covariances across spatio-temporal scales.",
