            "target_entity_type": "PhysicalFeature",
            "paragraph": "IK09 use spatially varying decorrelation scales of 300 km in the horizontal and 10 m in the vertical at the sea surface, and which increase linearly by 30 km/100 m and 6 m/100 m away from the surface.",
